\description{
Collect Finnish Liiga data from \url{https://liiga.fi/}: schedules,
goals, shot locations, box scores, standings and player stats. Also scrapes
NHL play-by-play data from \url{https://www.nhl.com/} and data from
\url{https://www.hockey-reference.com/}, including standings, player stats and
jersey number history. Built on the hockeyR package by Daniel Morse.
